2026-11-13T11:18:01.7816644Z                 A map of current data pointers to dictionaries of devices to already dispatched tied weights. For a given
2026-11-13T11:18:01.7817444Z                 execution device, this parameter is useful to reuse the first available pointer of a shared weight on the
2026-11-13T11:18:01.7818022Z                 device for all others, instead of duplicating memory.
2026-11-13T11:18:01.7818414Z             non_blocking (`bool`, *optional*, defaults to `False`):
